## 6. Mobile Device Accessories

- **Protective:** hard case (max protection), soft case (lighter), folio case (fold-over, card slots); screen protectors — glass (durable, clearer) vs. film (thin, less protective).
- **Power:** chargers (match device type), power banks (check capacity/ports).
- **Audio:** headphones/earbuds/speakers — wired (3.5 mm, USB-C, Lightning) vs. wireless (Bluetooth); check battery life & noise cancellation.
- **Connectivity:** extra cables, port replicators (laptop expansion).
- **Enhancement:** VR (fully digital) vs. AR (overlays digital onto real world) headsets, smartwatches, styluses, game controllers.

