### Quick Exam-Focus Reminders
- Know USB version → speed mapping and connector shapes.
- Lightning = Apple proprietary, 8-pin, MFi certified.
- RS-232 (DB-9/DB-25) vs. RS-422 (differential, longer range) vs. RS-485 (multi-point/SCADA).
- Bluetooth security terms: bluejacking, bluesnarfing, MITM, SSP.
- NFC = short range (≤4 cm), 3 modes, used for payments/tags/access.
- Wired charging/audio = more efficient & stable; wireless = more convenient.
- Battery health = keep charge between 20–80%, avoid heat.
